  - id: after-conversion
    on: { after: [2, 3] }
    presentation: [nearby_character_bubble, equipment_panel_update, persistent_world_change]
    world: The scale reading, moles, and molecule count connect with a continuous illuminated unit path.
    stage:
      wall:
      - path: [MASS, MOLES, MOLECULES]
        tone: ok
    panel: MASS -> MOLES -> MOLECULES
    bubbles:
    - who: abiola
      say: Now the tank scale and the reactor model are speaking the same language. Open the carbon ledger.

  - id: after-ledger
    on: { after: [4] }
    presentation: [nearby_character_bubble, equipment_panel_update, persistent_world_change]
    world: >-
