      methane shortfall remains red.
    # TWO ROWS, WRITTEN OUT. The panel line would give this beat a board for
    # free — see `stageFor` in tools/import-book.mjs — but as one row it is a
    # 53-character line across a board that can show two readings with their
    # own lamps, and the two readings are the point of the beat: the carbon
