      say: That is not good news. If the air is not holding us back, something else is.

  - id: after-limiting
    on: { after: [3] }
    world: A second feed display opens and highlights the hydrogen line.
    panel: HYDROGEN IS LIMITING METHANE PRODUCTION
    panelTone: alarm
    bubbles:
    - who: sundqvist
      say: The Martian air was never the bottleneck. We are not getting enough hydrogen.
    - who: abiola
