- title: Pressure Does Not Lie. Or Does It?
  card:
    header: 13 SHIFTS UNTIL THE LAUNCH WINDOW CLOSES
    title: PRESSURE DOES NOT TELL THE WHOLE TRUTH
    goNow: >-
      Go to the Hydrogen Store and meet Dr. Tomás Herrera, the reactor and safety engineer, beside
      the storage gauge.
    body: >-
      Hydrogen is now the leading suspect, but its storage gauge still shows nearly normal pressure.
      Total pressure can stay high when another gas replaces part of the hydrogen. At the Hydrogen
      Store, calculate total gas, sample each branch, and test the mixture while warming it. By the
      end of the mission, decide whether hydrogen leaked away or was replaced before reaching the
      reactor.
    objective: >-
      Find where usable hydrogen is lost even though the main pressure gauge looks normal.
  objective: >-
    Find where usable hydrogen is lost even though the main pressure gauge looks normal.
  stake: >-
    Hydrogen is now the leading suspect, but its storage gauge still shows nearly normal pressure.
    Total pressure can stay high when another gas replaces part of the hydrogen. At the Hydrogen
    Store, calculate total gas, sample each branch, and test the mixture while warming it. By the
    end of the mission, decide whether hydrogen leaked away or was replaced before reaching the
